{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01420","headline":"相和歌辞 莫愁曲 · 李贺","name":"相和歌辞 莫愁曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草生陇坂下，鵶噪城堞头。\n何人此城里，城角栽石榴。\n青丝系五马，黄金络双牛。\n白鱼驾莲船，夜作十里游。\n归来无人识，暗上沈香楼。\n罗牀倚瑶瑟，残月倾帘钩。\n今日槿花落，明朝梧树秋。\n若负平生意，何名作莫愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}